         period, quotes, or leading dash. If the agent changed no files, reply with \
         exactly {NO_NOTE}. Reply with only the line.\n\nTask:\n{}\n\nWhat the agent \
         did:\n{}",
        cut(prompt),
        cut(result)
    );
